Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**Summary:** When a table is divided into multiple tablets (this does not happen with only one tablet per table), it is possible for a whole-column update on a non-indexed column to cause a unique constraint violation on a different column, when no violation exists.\r\n\r\n**Test Case:**\r\n```\r\nCREATE TABLE test (\r\n  pk int PRIMARY KEY,\r\n  a int UNIQUE,\r\n  b int\r\n);\r\nINSERT INTO test VALUES (1, 2, 2), (2, 3, 3);\r\nUPDATE test SET b = 10;\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Actual Results:** The following error is returned after the `UPDATE` statement:\r\n```\r\nERROR:  duplicate key value violates unique constraint \"test_a_key\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected Results:** No error.\r\n\r\n**Note:** Updating each row individually (as in the SQL below) does not produce an error.\r\n```\r\nCREATE TABLE test (\r\n  pk int PRIMARY KEY,\r\n  a int UNIQUE,\r\n  b int\r\n);\r\nINSERT INTO test VALUES (1, 2, 2), (2, 3, 3);\r\nUPDATE test SET b = 10 WHERE pk = 1;\r\nUPDATE test SET b = 10 WHERE pk = 2;\r\n```\r\n**Note:** If no primary key column is specified, this error will only occur occasionally, hinting that this issue could be related to the placement of rows in different tablets.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1611/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2548003660,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDI1NDgwMDM2NjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/2548003660","actor":{"login":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"8cc24188b2af745b5faae9f82099f89b14b871cd","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits/8cc24188b2af745b5faae9f82099f89b14b871cd","created_at":"2019-08-10T0